    "body": "## Problem\r\n\r\nWhen `:edit` matches several files, E77 only says \"Too many file names\". \r\nIt does not explain that the glob files are not supported.\r\n\r\n## Solution\r\n\r\nUpdate the message \"Too many file names\" with a hint by adding \"glob not allowed\" and document `:next` as the alternative.\r\n\r\nSupersedes #39843 and incorporates its remaining review feedback.\r\n\r\nCloses #12139.\r\n\r\n## Tests\r\n\r\n```\r\nmake lintdoc\r\nmake functionaltest TEST_FILE=test/functional/ex_cmds/edit_spec.lua\r\n```",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-16T14:23:28Z",
